      "content": "i know i should talk to my doctor but they're booked for like two weeks and i really need to focus for work. i'm not feeling like i'm having a heart attack or anything, just a bit of a racing heart here and there when i take my dose. do you think it's actually dangerous to just take my normal 20mg for a few more days until my appointment? i've taken it for years and never had a problem before.",
